Package: healthsim
Title: Simulate Synthetic Health Insurance Portfolios and Panels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sbusiso", "Mdingi", email = "sbusiso@mdingi.co.za",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Generates synthetic South African health insurance data with a
    known data-generating process, for teaching and testing pricing models.
    One function simulates a cross-sectional portfolio of principal members
    with negative binomial claim counts and a lognormal-Pareto severity
    mixture. Another simulates a multi-year open-cohort panel with ageing,
    smoking cessation, wearable activity and sleep data joined by a Clayton
    copula, claims inflation, annual benefit limits, lapses and deaths.
    Every parameter can be changed, and the true expected frequency and
    severity are available for checking fitted models.
